    {
      "id": "u_2e1756424039195f431979f8_0",
      "kind": "td",
      "source": "Similar to __TRILIUM_PH_0__Custom Widgets__TRILIUM_PH_1__, but dedicated to the __TRILIUM_PH_2__Launch Bar__TRILIUM_PH_3__. These can simply introduce new buttons or graphical elements to the bar.",
