    {
      "id": "u_db6c142bb61f2265b0b4507d_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Widgets require a certain format in order for Trilium to be able to integrate them into the UI.",
      "sourceHash": "db6c142bb61f2265b0b4507d6785c9a245a7c73fe20ed6c50577e952c12060dc",
      "context": "Frontend Basics > Widgets",
      "contextHash": "cedcb7824809904df280198b3320e5044b5176712ec7198a6afbd145661be99e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f88648fb2a5da6fa34eccfa3_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "For legacy widgets, the script note must export a __TRILIUM_PH_0__ or a derived one (see __TRILIUM_PH_1__Note context aware widget__TRILIUM_PH_2__ or __TRILIUM_PH_3__Right pane widget__TRILIUM_PH_4__).",
      "sourceHash": "f88648fb2a5da6fa34eccfa3c46aa62374c293ac4a5fb478a4a93bf56087b031",
      "context": "Frontend Basics > Widgets",
      "contextHash": "cedcb7824809904df280198b3320e5044b5176712ec7198a6afbd145661be99e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_84ee7071e602c04a65acd4d2_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "For Preact widgets, a built-in helper called __TRILIUM_PH_0__ needs to be used.",
      "sourceHash": "84ee7071e602c04a65acd4d24190dadb2adfc104e202ca27491a8dc54fc9c80f",
      "context": "Frontend Basics > Widgets",
      "contextHash": "cedcb7824809904df280198b3320e5044b5176712ec7198a6afbd145661be99e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8dc7f408a17144b48155fb53_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "For more information, see __TRILIUM_PH_0__Custom Widgets__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "8dc7f408a17144b48155fb53ee0adf216ec7aef7ab2717ab2c11672567f4729f",
